      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herron_Island",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "All travel to Herron Island happens by boat, mainly the HMC ferry “Charlie Wells,” and a guest pass signed by a member is required.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herron_Island",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Herron Island is one of the few privately owned islands in Puget Sound, with every parcel of land, including tidelands to mean sea level, owned by residents.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
        24,
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
